    "message": "Add suite v2 validation reruns after #169 and note the earlier runs\n\nThe six suite validation results ran with a suite-only policy_registry,\nso queue, relationship and the misinformation pressure did not use the\ndeclared models until #170. Rerun the three v2 studies on develop at\n7cc948e with unchanged conditions and save them as *-after-169.json.\nRerunning at 249cee6 reproduces the original v2 files, final state\nhashes included, and the baselines are unchanged, so every difference\ncomes from the #169 fix.\n\nNotes in 13 and 14 list both sets of values. The interpretation and\ngate judgments stay as written for the model owner to review (#171).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
